{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Jose.Jwa</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"jose","href":"../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Jose","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Jwa","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[{"title":"JSON Web Algorithm","href":"#json-web-algorithm","children":[]}],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<h2 id=\"json-web-algorithm\"><a href=\"#json-web-algorithm\" class=\"anchor\"></a>JSON Web Algorithm</h2><p><a href=\"https://www.tools.ietf.org/rfc/rfc7518.html\">Link to RFC</a></p><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-alg\"><a href=\"#type-alg\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> alg</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-alg.RS256\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.RS256\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`RS256</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>RSASSA-PKCS1-v1_5 using SHA-256 - Recommended (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-3.1\">RFC 7518 §3.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.HS256\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.HS256\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`HS256</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>HMAC using SHA-256 - Required (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-3.1\">RFC 7518 §3.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.ES256\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.ES256\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`ES256</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>ECDSA using P-256 and SHA-256 - Recommended+ (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-3.1\">RFC 7518 §3.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.ES384\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.ES384\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`ES384</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>ECDSA using P-384 and SHA-384 - Optional (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-3.1\">RFC 7518 §3.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.ES512\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.ES512\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`ES512</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>ECDSA using P-521 and SHA-512 - Optional (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-3.1\">RFC 7518 §3.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.EdDSA\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.EdDSA\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`EdDSA</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>EdDSA signature algorithm - Optional <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8037.html\">Link to RFC 8037 §3.1</a></p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.Ed25519\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.Ed25519\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Ed25519</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Ed25519 signature algorithm - Fully-specified replacement for EdDSA <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9864.html\">Link to RFC 9864 §3.1</a></p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.RSA_OAEP\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.RSA_OAEP\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`RSA_OAEP</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>RSAES OAEP using default parameters - Recommended+ (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.1\">RFC 7518 §4.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.RSA1_5\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.RSA1_5\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`RSA1_5</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>RSA PKCS 1 v1.5 - Recommended- (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.1\">RFC 7518 §4.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.Dir\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.Dir\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Dir</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Direct use of a shared symmetric key - Recommended (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.1\">RFC 7518 §4.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.A128KW\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.A128KW\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`A128KW</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>AES Key Wrap using 128-bit key - Recommended (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.1\">RFC 7518 §4.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc3394\">RFC 3394</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.A256KW\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.A256KW\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`A256KW</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>AES Key Wrap using 256-bit key - Recommended (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.1\">RFC 7518 §4.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc3394\">RFC 3394</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.ECDH_ES\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.ECDH_ES\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`ECDH_ES</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Elliptic Curve Diffie-Hellman Ephemeral Static key agreement using Concat KDF - Recommended+ (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.1\">RFC 7518 §4.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.6\">§4.6</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.ECDH_ES_A128KW\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.ECDH_ES_A128KW\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`ECDH_ES_A128KW</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>ECDH-ES using Concat KDF and CEK wrapped with &quot;A128KW&quot; - Recommended (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.1\">RFC 7518 §4.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.6\">§4.6</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.ECDH_ES_A256KW\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.ECDH_ES_A256KW\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`ECDH_ES_A256KW</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>ECDH-ES using Concat KDF and CEK wrapped with &quot;A256KW&quot; - Recommended (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.6\">RFC 7518 §4.6</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-4.6\">§4.6</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.None\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.None\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`None</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>No digital signature or MAC performed - Optional (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-3.1\">RFC 7518 §3.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-alg.Unsupported\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-alg.Unsupported\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Unsupported <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> string</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div></div><p><a href=\"https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7518#section-3.1\">Link to RFC 7518 §3.1</a></p><ul><li>Signature algorithms supported: <code>HS256</code>, <code>RS256</code>, <code>ES256</code>, <code>ES384</code>, <code>ES512</code>, <code>EdDSA</code>, <code>Ed25519</code>.</li><li>Key management algorithms supported: <code>RSA1_5</code>, <code>RSA_OAEP</code>, <code>Dir</code>, <code>A128KW</code>, <code>A256KW</code>, <code>ECDH_ES</code>, <code>ECDH_ES_A128KW</code>, <code>ECDH_ES_A256KW</code>.</li></ul><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-alg_to_string\"><a href=\"#val-alg_to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> alg_to_string : <span><a href=\"#type-alg\">alg</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-alg_of_string\"><a href=\"#val-alg_of_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> alg_of_string : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-alg\">alg</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-alg_to_json\"><a href=\"#val-alg_to_json\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> alg_to_json : <span><a href=\"#type-alg\">alg</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Yojson</span>.Safe.t</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-alg_of_json\"><a href=\"#val-alg_of_json\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> alg_of_json : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Yojson</span>.Safe.t <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-alg\">alg</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-use\"><a href=\"#type-use\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> use</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-use.Sig\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-use.Sig\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Sig</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Key used for digital signature or MAC (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7517/#section-4.2\">RFC 7517 §4.2</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-use.Enc\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-use.Enc\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Enc</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Key used for encrypting data (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7517/#section-4.2\">RFC 7517 §4.2</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-use.Unsupported\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-use.Unsupported\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Unsupported <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> string</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-use_to_string\"><a href=\"#val-use_to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> use_to_string : <span><a href=\"#type-use\">use</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-use_of_string\"><a href=\"#val-use_of_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> use_of_string : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-use\">use</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-use_of_alg\"><a href=\"#val-use_of_alg\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> use_of_alg : <span><a href=\"#type-alg\">alg</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-use\">use</a> option</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-kty\"><a href=\"#type-kty\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> kty</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-kty.oct\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-kty.oct\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`oct</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Octet sequence (used to represent symmetric keys) - Required (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-6.1\">RFC 7518 §6.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-kty.RSA\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-kty.RSA\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`RSA</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>RSA - Required (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-6.1\">RFC 7518 §6.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc3447\">RFC 3447</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-kty.EC\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-kty.EC\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`EC</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Elliptic Curve - Recommended+ (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-6.1\">RFC 7518 §6.1</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-kty.OKP\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-kty.OKP\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`OKP</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>Octet Key Pair - Optional <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8037.html\">Link to RFC 8037 §2</a></p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-kty.Unsupported\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-kty.Unsupported\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Unsupported <span class=\"keyword\">of</span> string</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><a href=\"https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7518#section-6.1\">Link to RFC</a></p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-kty_to_string\"><a href=\"#val-kty_to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> kty_to_string : <span><a href=\"#type-kty\">kty</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-kty_of_string\"><a href=\"#val-kty_of_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> kty_of_string : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-kty\">kty</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-enc\"><a href=\"#type-enc\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> enc</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-enc.A128CBC_HS256\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-enc.A128CBC_HS256\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`A128CBC_HS256</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>AES_128_CBC_HMAC_SHA_256 authenticated encryption algorithm - Required (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-5.1\">RFC 7518 §5.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-5.2.3\">§5.2.3</a>) https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7518#section-5.2.3</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-enc.A256CBC_HS512\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-enc.A256CBC_HS512\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`A256CBC_HS512</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>AES_256_CBC_HMAC_SHA_512 authenticated encryption algorithm - Required (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-5.1\">RFC 7518 §5.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-5.2.5\">§5.2.5</a>) https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc7518#section-5.2.5</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-enc.A128GCM\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-enc.A128GCM\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`A128GCM</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>AES GCM using 128-bit key - Recommended (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-5.1\">RFC 7518 §5.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-5.3\">§5.3</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li><li id=\"type-enc.A256GCM\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-enc.A256GCM\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`A256GCM</span></code><div class=\"def-doc\"><span class=\"comment-delim\">(*</span><p>AES GCM using 256-bit key - Recommended (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-5.1\">RFC 7518 §5.1</a>, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-5.3\">§5.3</a>)</p><span class=\"comment-delim\">*)</span></div></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Content Encryption Algorithms for JWE (<a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/info/rfc7518/#section-5.1\">RFC 7518 §5.1</a>)</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-enc_to_string\"><a href=\"#val-enc_to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> enc_to_string : <span><a href=\"#type-enc\">enc</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-enc_of_string\"><a href=\"#val-enc_of_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> enc_of_string : <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <a href=\"#type-enc\">enc</a></span></code></div></div>"}